{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t選舉委員會界別分組選舉結果陸續公布，法律界15名當選人分別是譚雪欣、梁定邦、劉漢銓、曹紹基、盧懿杏、李連君、鄭程、徐奇鵬、林穎茜、袁國強、張天任、湯家驊、陸栩然、蔣瑞福、藍德業。<br/>\n<br/>\n律師會主席湯文龍落敗。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：黃佩珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T13:43:45.445008+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T13:23:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T13:57:29.406839+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T13:37:22.517461+00:00","content_hash":"6b6a6692fb526a74ee03466b50b444805cd86ba59fb075dab2eaa3b4b2a208af","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}